  hero_watch: "Watch the video", hero_screen: "How it scrapes: tick the systems, click and you're done", cmp_kicker: "Before and after", cmp_title: "Your collection, before and after the program", cmp_sub: "Drag the handle to compare. Demo games.", cmp_before: "Before", cmp_after: "After", shots_hint: "Click a screenshot to see it full size.", news_kicker: "What's new", news_title: "What version {v} brings", news_all: "See all versions on GitHub", theme_toggle: "Switch between light and dark theme", lb_close: "Close", lb_prev: "Previous", lb_next: "Next", dl_req_win: "64-bit Windows 10 or 11", dl_req_linux: "Ubuntu 22.04, Linux Mint 21, Debian 12 or newer (64-bit)", dl_size: "{size} zip", f10_t: "Updates itself", f10_d: "It tells you when there is a new version, shows you what's new and installs it with one click. If something fails, it goes back to the previous version by itself.", video_close: "Close the video",
  badge_update: "Updates itself", q6: "How is the program updated?", a6: "By itself. When it starts it checks for a new version, shows you what's new and, if you accept, downloads it, installs it and reopens. Your data and your output folder are not touched, and the previous version is kept in case you want to go back. If you have 0.5.40 or older, download the new one from this website just once: from then on, updates arrive by themselves.",
  ver_line: "Version {v} · updated on {d} at {t}", disc_title: "Disclaimer", disc_text: "KukoScrapingFree is provided “as is”, without any warranty, and may contain errors. <b>Back up</b> your ROMs and your gamelist.xml files before using it and before copying anything to your Batocera. Each user is responsible for the changes they make to their system and uses the program at their own risk: the author accepts no liability for any damage or data loss it may cause.", disc_dl: "By downloading it you accept the <a href=\"#aviso\">disclaimer</a>.",
